        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Fusion SE-A2 Leverset And 100-A2 Deadbolt </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade for heavy duty security, this stainless steel deadbolt and lever entryset has a limited lifetime warranty. This passage lever and single cylinder deadbolt set has a simple contemporary design that features a sleek concealed screw assembly. A Fusion made entry set, it is both chic and streamlined. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It has an optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/simple-stainless-steel-leverset-fusion-se-a2\"><b>SE-A2 Stainless Steel Leverset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Simple Stainless Steel SE-A2 Lever and 100-A2 Deadbolt Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" throw bolt with Interior roll pins.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass Schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Cycle tested to ANSI standards.</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly of leverset with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n<li>Includes passage function door leverset and single cylinder deadbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Stainless Steel SE-A2 Lever With 100-A2 Deadbolt Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b> is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while the <b>Passage Lever Set</b> latch operates from either side of door by using a spindle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Stainless Steel Entryset, Fusion SE-A2/100-A2",
                "description": "Fusion Stainless Steel SE-A2 Lever With 100-A2 Deadbolt - Made for heavy duty security, this stainless steel deadbolt and lever entryset has a limited lifetime warranty. This passage lever and single cylinder deadbolt set has a simple contemporary design that features a sleek concealed screw assembly. A Fusion made entry set, it is both chic and streamlined. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "FUS-SE-A2/100-A2 Contemporary Entry Lever Locks, Contemporary Stainless Steel Entry Lever Set with Deadbolts, Fusion 2080 contemporary stainless steel levers, Fusion 3000 Contemporary Stainless Steel Deadbolts, Fusion 2080 levers with 3000 deadbolt Entrysets, stainless steel Lever Lock Sets, south beach levers, Simple Stainless Steel SE-A2 Lever and 100-A2 Deabolt Sets,"
